<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Ceramic Industries interim shr, div up.</title>
<headline>Ceramic Industries interim shr, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to January 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		41.9	vs    32.3</p>
<p>    - attrib		  43.0	vs    32.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  8 0	vs    6.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   7.72	vs    5.88</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		  12.56	vs    9.63</p>
<p>    Tax			 4.83	vs    3.75</p>
<p>Interest from</p>
<p>    investments	     1.87	vs    1.40</p>
<p>    Turnover		 92.67	vs    61.36</p>
<p>Div payable: April 11</p>
<p>On register: March 27</p>
<p>Full name: Ceramic Industries</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said industry conditions were likely to remain unchanged for the remainder of the year. It said it expected to maintain current earnings growth.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
